# Persistent local runtime archives (TV-1 live runs, ad-hoc drills).
# These are intentionally NOT public: they hold pending OTS receipts
# that are only useful on the originating host until block-height
# collection finalises them. The merkle_root + manifest are
# reproducible offline from the deterministic test fixtures.
.runtime/
